          "rawSql": "SELECT profundidad_km AS \"Profundidad Real (km)\", magnitud AS \"Magnitud\" FROM sismos.eventos WHERE $__timeFilter(fecha_evento) AND tipo_evento = 'earthquake' AND magnitud >= ${rango_magnitud} AND region IN (${region:sqlstring}) AND cluster_id::text IN (${cluster:sqlstring}) AND profundidad_fija = false ORDER BY fecha_evento DESC LIMIT 3000;",
